    CREATED --> CANCELED : fact [expired, no intent] / cancelUnpaid()
    FAILED --> SUCCEEDED : recovery [paid, matches] / succeed()
    CANCELED --> SUCCEEDED : recovery [paid, matches] / succeed()
    FAILED --> FAILED : fact [paid] / open review case
    CANCELED --> CANCELED : fact [paid] / open review case
    SUCCEEDED --> SUCCEEDED : fact [repeat or unpaid] / no change
    SUCCEEDED : entry / fulfil or require refund; record outcome
